        <mxCell id="VqkJ6D8PxmnF8iVDtasi-1" value="&amp;nbsp;브러시는 어떻게 구현이 되는가.&lt;div&gt;필요한 텍스처: 원본 Tex, alpha Tex&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;P1부터 P2까지 선을 그으면,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;해당 선과 픽셀이 일정거리 이상이면&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;alphaTex를 해당 alpha로 찰힌다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;이때 선에 애매하게 걸쳐있는건 alpha를 보간해서 칠하고&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;이미 칠해진 alpha가 있다면 그중에 가장 큰 값을 칠한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;그리고 렌더링은 alphaTex를 기반으로 원본 Tex에 해당 색을 칠한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;위 두개의 과정은&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;scissorTest를 통해&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;dirtyRect내부에서만 작동되게 한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;칠하는건 offscreenTex에 렌더링하고,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;그 offscreen을 canvas화면에 위치에 맞게 렌더링 한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-50" y="1250" width="410" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VqkJ6D8PxmnF8iVDtasi-2" value="Canvas" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="600" y="1500" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VqkJ6D8PxmnF8iVDtasi-4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="VqkJ6D8PxmnF8iVDtasi-3" target="VqkJ6D8PxmnF8iVDtasi-23">
